# TrAIce — Environment variables
#
# This project is a frontend-only prototype. It reads bundled sample CSV data
# from `public/sample-ai-usage.csv` and accepts user CSV uploads client-side.
# No runtime environment variables are currently required to run or build it.
#
# Add any future variables below, e.g.:
# VITE_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.example.com
